      "label": "event, TZID that will not resolve",
      "kind": "text/calendar",
      "fixture": "fixtures/event-unknown-tzid.ics",
      "note": "the TZID names no VTIMEZONE and no known zone, so the time is read as floating rather than dropped: the error is bounded by an offset, where an empty key would move the item to the far end of the listing. dtstart_tzid still carries the parameter verbatim",
