    {
      "label": "event, no UID",
      "kind": "text/calendar",
      "fixture": "fixtures/event-no-uid.ics",
      "note": "the case that pins what is NOT fixed: content carrying no usable UID falls back to a writer-derived link_id rather than being refused, and the format says nothing about what that id is. A consumer checks that an id was derived and that the item was accepted, never that it equals some value",
